    "describe_ch": "介紹不織布之成型原理及不織布工程中各運動之動作原理。使學習者擁有不織布之理論基礎，並啟發學習者研究與開發的實作能力。",
    "describe_eh": "To introduce principles of nonwoven formation and the motion of the process. To help the student to build up the foundation of theory and practical training, and to enlighten the study on the topic.",
